				(property "Description" "XT60 connector for an M18 pack to plug into. Board-side MALE, matching V2. Pin 1 = + pack positive, pin 2 = - pack negative. One per isolated domain; each pack feeds its own divider and bulk cap. Per-pack overcurrent is handled by the pack REDLINK BMS, so there are no board fuses here."
