				)
				(property "Description" "High-side P-channel MOSFET, winch kill switch. Pin order G-D-S to match TO-220. Carries the full winch current: at 20 A, 10 mOhm burns 4 W and 5 mOhm burns 2 W, so pick Rds(on) with the heatsink in mind. Needs >=40 V Vds for an M18 pack at 21 V max. Vgs is held to about -10.5 V by the R34/R35 divider, inside the usual +/-20 V limit. FAIL-SAFE OFF: R34 pulls the gate to source whenever Q2 is not driven."
					(at 0 0 0)
					(show_name no)
					(do_not_autoplace no)
					(hide yes)
					(effects
						(font
							(size 1.27 1.27)
						)
